{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013553/block/singleImage/3279476/df/01M8C2T989Y6GH2388VAH412YV.jpg?updatedAt=1795701999\"/><p>每逢聖誕，利東街的節日燈飾總吸引不少市民到訪。今年商場以「Starry Presents」為主題，將林蔭大道化身巨型聖誕禮物工房，並首度於兩端入口外牆繫上巨型紅色蝴蝶結，配合逾200件禮物盒、星星及雪花裝飾，營造濃厚節日氣氛。 活動期間，中庭設有8米高聖誕樹，而每年備受歡迎的「Let It Snow!」飄雪匯演亦將回歸，12月起合共上演50場，成為灣仔區冬日打卡熱點。</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013553/block/singleImage/3279478/df/01M8C2T98G3D0QRQ2YC4H055D6.jpg?updatedAt=1795701999\"/><p>此外，商場今年加入「拆禮物」概念，推出「Unwrap the Wonder」互動拍照體驗，並設有北歐聖誕市集及愛心禮物限定店，匯聚特色禮品及節日美食，讓市民在感受聖誕氣氛之餘，亦可與親友分享節日暖意。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T21:44:15.808484+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:13.857698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T21:37:36.673485+00:00","content_hash":"132690e0d3ca3ee7dcad355642134b8e447ec73da4d4a82bad1c35c6acfe2ad9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T21:44:15.808484+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}